# Colorstorm Stallion's opus is "Whenever you CAST an instant or sorcery spell"; a copy is never cast (CR 707.10a). With Leyline of
# Resonance on the battlefield, Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at its own Stallion: the Leyline copies the Bolt (aimed at Bot2), but only the
# cast triggers the opus. The Stallion is a 4/4 - not a 5/5 - and takes the Bolt's three damage and lives; the copy's three go to Bot2
# (20 to 17). One mana was spent, so there is only the one Stallion.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Colorstorm Stallion
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

